by \f[CR]cmd_serialize()\f[R].
Arbitrary or adversarial JSON input may cause undefined behavior.
.IP \(bu 2
String values are unescaped during extraction (\f[CR]\(rs\(dq\f[R] \->
\f[CR]\(dq\f[R], \f[CR]\(rs\(rs\f[R] \-> \f[CR]\(rs\f[R],
\f[CR]\(rsn\f[R] \-> newline, etc.).
.IP \(bu 2
